# TDengine-TSDB-Docs Repository Notice

This repository is an **internal workspace** for TDengine-TSDB product
research and development.

## Scope and Purpose

- Used only for internal product design, development, testing, release
	documentation, and engineering collaboration.
- Used to provide structured project context for internal AI-assisted
	development and knowledge retrieval.

## Access and Distribution Restrictions

- This repository and its contents are **not for public disclosure**.
- External publishing, redistribution, mirroring, or sharing is prohibited
	unless explicitly approved by the company.
- Any use outside company-authorized internal scenarios is not permitted.

## Compliance and Responsibility

- All contributors and users must comply with company security,
	confidentiality, and intellectual property policies.
- If any sensitive information is found to be exposed unintentionally,
	report and remediate immediately according to internal procedures.

All rights are reserved by the company and/or relevant rights holders.
